          {table.getRowModel().rows.map((row) => (
            <tr key={row.id} className="hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors">
              {row.getVisibleCells().map((cell) => (
                <td key={cell.id} className="px-6 py-4 text-white/90">
                  {flexRender(cell.column.columnDef.cell, cell.getContext())}
                </td>
              ))}
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  );
}
```

## 3. Automation (Event-Driven Cloud Functions)
```typescript
// ✅ Immutable Activity Stream Trigger
import { onDocumentCreated } from "firebase-functions/v2/firestore";
import * as admin from "firebase-admin";

export const onLeadCreated = onDocumentCreated("leads/{leadId}", async (event) => {
  const snapshot = event.data;
  if (!snapshot) return;
  const lead = snapshot.data();

  // 1. Log to immutable stream
  await admin.firestore().collection("activities").add({
    action: "LEAD_CAPTURED",
    targetId: event.params.leadId,
    targetType: "lead",
    metadata: { source: lead.source, email: lead.email },
    timestamp: admin.firestore.FieldValue.serverTimestamp(),
  });

  // 2. Trigger external hooks downstream (e.g., Stripe, Resend)
});
```

## 4. Anti-Patterns (BANNED)
- **No Third-Party CRMs**: Do not suggest Salesforce or HubSpot integrations.
- **No Client-Side Filtering**: Use Firestore Indexes for generic queries.
- **No Legacy UI**: Material UI / Bootstrap tables are PROHIBITED.

## 5. ADMIN & USER DASHBOARD MASTERY
- **KEYBOARD SOVEREIGNTY (The Command Core)**: Every dashboard MUST implement a global `cmd+k` / `ctrl+k` Command Palette. Admins must be able to search orders, jump to analytics, and create products without touching the mouse (Linear-inspired).
- **VIEWPORT & DATA DENSITY (Dynamic Density)**: Data tables must support "Standard" and "Compact" views. Space must never be wasted.
- **CONTEXTUAL SIDE-PANELS**: Never force a full-page reload for quick edits. Order details and product variant updates MUST open in sliding side-panels or modal sheets (Shopify Polaris/Shadcn style).
- **STATE REVERIE (Zero-Loading Illusion)**: All non-destructive mutations (e.g., changing fulfillment status) MUST update the UI instantly before the server confirms. Use staggered skeleton components matching the final layout matrix.
- **ACTIONABLE TELEMETRY (Not Just Charts)**: Analytics components must provide actionable vectors (e.g., pair a drop in sales with a one-click filter to view "Abandoned Carts Last 24h").
- **LIQUID AESTHETIC ENFORCEMENT**: Modals and dropdowns must use `backdrop-blur` and ultra-subtle `border-white/10` to maintain the overarching v6.2 Liquid Glass visual framework. No flat, dead surfaces.
- **RESPONSIVE COLLAPSE PROTOCOL**: The admin sidebar MUST collapse to a minimal icon rail on tablets and disappear into a bottom sheet or hamburger menu on mobile. The main action area must remain primary on all screens.

